Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.17,0:00:27.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作为一个猎手我比你出色得多  更强大  更聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a better hunter -- stronger,smarter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.24,0:00:29.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能把你唯恐避之不及的恶魔控制住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can take out demons you're too scared to go near.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.74,0:00:32.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我不是故意要说那些话的  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I didn't mean the things I said back there,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.77,0:00:34.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是中了海妖的咒语才这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That it was just the siren's spell talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.31,0:00:35.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.44,0:00:37.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  那么我们和好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,we're good? yeah,we're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.49,0:00:48.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧好吧  来吧  现在告诉我  为什么会有那样的三分球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,okay,now,come on,you tell me -- why kick that field goal?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.82,0:00:50.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为这就是橄榄球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it's called football.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.49,0:00:53.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  应该说是充满奇迹的橄榄球  那个三分球让我爽歪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,it's called fantasy football,and those 3 points screwed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.89,0:00:56.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说真的  吉姆  你需要享受生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously,Jim,you need to get a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.33,0:00:58.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  哥们儿  有零钱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,guys,got any change?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.13,0:00:59.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry,pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.90,0:01:02.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把你们的钱包交出来怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about your wallets?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.94,0:01:03.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题  放松点儿  好吗  \N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem. take it easy,all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.94,0:01:04.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快把钱包给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give me the wallets!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.91,0:01:06.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冷静点  哥们儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on,man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.68,0:01:08.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.64,0:01:11.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉姆  吉姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim! jim!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.31,0:01:13.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去报警\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call 911 -- now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.71,0:01:15.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.55,0:01:19.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺住啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.26,0:01:26.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.56,0:01:28.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别乱动  别乱动  哥们儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move. don't move,man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:32.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉良好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.87,0:01:36.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你甚至都没流血\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not even bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.04,0:01:41.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉我一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.78,0:01:46.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在怎么还会活着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you even alive right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.02,0:01:51.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.76,0:02:03.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不  你是对的  这很明显有古怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,no,no,you're right,it's definitely weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.86,0:02:06.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  鲍比  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,Bobby,thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.27,0:02:08.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.50,0:02:12.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比在怀俄明州发现了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby found something in wyoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.11,0:02:13.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有活干了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A job?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.51,0:02:14.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.88,0:02:17.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个小镇  过去的一个半星期里没有一个人死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Small town,no one's died in the past week and a half.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.24,0:02:19.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就不正常了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That so unusual?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.31,0:02:21.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听听他们如何摆脱死亡的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,it's how they're not dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.32,0:02:24.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个癌症晚期的家伙蹦蹦跳跳走出了医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}One guy with terminal cancer strolls right out of hospice,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.45,0:02:28.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有个家伙让劫匪给崩了 毫发无损的离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another guy gets capped by a mugger and walks away without a scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.42,0:02:30.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,崩在屁眼上了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capped in the ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.82,0:02:36.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警方说  詹金斯先生胸部遭到9毫米口径手枪的近距离射击\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Police say Mr. Jenkins was shot in the heart at point-blank range by a 9mm."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.70,0:02:39.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道他肥的像个轮胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's not a doughnut?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.07,0:02:41.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,街坊们都说是个奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locals are saying it's a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.34,0:02:44.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.41,0:02:47.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那背后一定有问题 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got to be something nasty,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.41,0:02:48.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人做了交易或是什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,people making deals or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.51,0:02:51.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这样认为吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.55,0:02:53.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那还能是什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else would it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.28,0:02:54.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.92,0:02:58.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  咱们出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,get that to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.02,0:03:02.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.56,0:03:09.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.67,0:03:14.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定要我一起去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure you want me going with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.67,0:03:15.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道为什么不和你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why wouldn't I? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.00,0:03:18.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想去托你的后腿或是什么也不做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to be holding you back or nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.07,0:03:22.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥们儿  我说几百遍了那是海妖说的  不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude,I've told you a hundred times,that was the siren talking,not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.18,0:03:23.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们忽略这一段好不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we get past this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.58,0:03:27.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,we're past it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.28,0:03:32.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是说你们是写博客的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now,you two said you were bloggers?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.45,0:03:34.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的先生 flooredbythelord.com\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes,sir. flooredbythelord.com.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.96,0:03:37.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,博客里记的都是主的神迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of God's glory fit to blog.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.63,0:03:41.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一些镇上的人说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of the people around town are
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.39,0:03:43.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说你所经历的是一场奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saying what happened to you was a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.70,0:03:44.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  历历在目\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was. Plain as day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.90,0:03:46.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么那么确信呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you be so sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.30,0:03:47.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还有其他的解释吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How else do you explain it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.50,0:03:49.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,医生都不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doctors can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.24,0:03:53.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的心脏里有一颗子弹  像个小水阀\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a bullet in my heart,and it's pumping like a piston.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.04,0:03:54.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你如何解释呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,how do you explain it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.45,0:04:04.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说实话我不是谁的圣徒  也不是什么年度优秀老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,honestly,I was nobody's saint -- not exactly father of the year,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.37,0:04:05.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.02,0:04:06.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.49,0:04:10.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是那家伙给了我一枪我却没流一滴血\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when that guy shot me and I didn't bleed a drop?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.19,0:04:12.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只知道主给了我第二次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just knew the lord was giving me a second chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.96,0:04:16.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.10,0:04:19.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得  像是有天使在保佑着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had this feeling -- like angels were watching over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.94,0:04:24.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你们是不会理解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't expect you guys to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.41,0:04:28.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会去尝试的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,we'll just have to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.84,0:04:30.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不必勉强自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't have happened to have
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.61,0:04:33.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你过去的一周在十字路口转悠过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swung by a crossroads in the past week or so?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.55,0:04:35.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.38,0:04:37.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你遇到某个人...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you met someone...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.02,0:04:38.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是黑色眼球\N{\fnArial\fs30}With black eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.25,0:04:40.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或是红色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or red?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.72,0:04:42.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们说你们是干什么的来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who'd you guys say you were again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.86,0:04:48.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系  谢谢你抽出时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind. Thank you for your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.86,0:04:51.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.93,0:04:53.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有收获吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.53,0:04:55.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个癌症生还者\N{\fnArial\fs30}That cancer survivor?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.07,0:04:57.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他临床诊断已经死了  他妻子拔掉的插管\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was clinically dead,his wife pulled the plug,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.72,0:05:00.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在他在和他妻子庆祝20周年结婚纪念日\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now he's taking her out for their 20th anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.94,0:05:02.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-有做过交易的迹象吗  -没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any sign of a deal? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.78,0:05:04.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么样  发现有什么死人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you? Found anyone dying around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.48,0:05:06.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,科尔·格里芬斯之后就没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not since Cole Griffith.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.21,0:05:07.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他10天前过世的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He dropped 10 days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.45,0:05:09.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是我找到的最后一个死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the last death I could find.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.32,0:05:11.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么你在想什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,what are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.45,0:05:13.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许他就是人们所说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh,maybe it is what the people say it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.69,0:05:15.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miracles?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.32,0:05:19.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  以我们的经验  什么时候会有奇迹发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean,our experience,when do miracles just happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.36,0:05:21.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里头没有交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,there's no deals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.90,0:05:24.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里没有宗教治愈师\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's,uh,no skeevy faith healers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.90,0:05:28.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些灵魂不能重见光明\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,these souls just ain't getting dragged into the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.54,0:05:32.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是附近没有载体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe 'cause there's no one around to carry them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.64,0:05:35.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.98,0:05:39.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死神  是他们做的  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,grim reapers -- that's what they do,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.28,0:05:41.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,游荡的鬼魂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shlepp souls?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.38,0:05:43.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果死神不在镇上  就没人死掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,if death ain't in town -- then nobody's dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.72,0:05:46.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以呢  本地的死神罢工了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what? the local reaper's on strike?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.25,0:05:48.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玩九球台球去了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Playing the back nine?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.19,0:05:49.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know,Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.82,0:05:51.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们找个也许知道内情的人谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,then,let's talk to somebody who might.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.96,0:05:55.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我最后遇到的是个抱抱熊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,last I checked,huggy bear ain't available.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.33,0:05:56.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  哥们儿  那个孩子  孩子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,dude,the kid. the kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.70,0:05:58.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那孩子绝对死透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kid's a doornail. exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.57,0:06:00.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他是这里最后一个死掉的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,if he was the last person to die around here,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.51,0:06:01.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是他看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then maybe he's seen something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.90,0:06:04.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该和他谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.17,0:06:06.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢你对那的解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love how matter-of-fact you are about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.01,0:06:08.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奇怪的生灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.16,0:06:28.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定这会管用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure this is gonna work?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.06,0:06:31.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.43,0:06:34.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是如果他的鬼魂在附近  这至少能驱走他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if his spirit's around,this should smoke him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.04,0:06:40.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  这工作很狗屁  就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? This job is jacked,that's what.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.31,0:06:42.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.31,0:06:46.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要我赶走一个怪物或是焚尸  咱是做了好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to gank a monster or torch a corpse,hey,let's light it up,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.29,0:06:46.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.81,0:06:48.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.21,0:06:51.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们搞清楚的话  那些人就要死掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we fix whatever this is,people are gonna start dropping dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.05,0:06:53.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无辜的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.95,0:06:59.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我也不想他们死  但是大自然是有规律的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,I don't want them to die,either,Dean,but there's a natural order.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.03,0:07:00.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没开玩笑  对吧  什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're kidding,right? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.59,0:07:02.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没觉得这有多讽刺吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't see the irony in that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.50,0:07:06.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说你和我就像是大自然规律的传递者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,you and me,we're like the poster guys of the unnatural order.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.73,0:07:08.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们所做的就是传递死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we do is ditch death.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.17,0:07:10.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  但是常规对我们并不适用  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,but the normal rules don't really apply to us,do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.01,0:07:17.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是如此的与众不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're no different than anybody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.41,0:07:21.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被恶魔之血所染\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm infected with demon blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.41,0:07:22.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你下过地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.85,0:07:25.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我知道你想认为自己是管子工乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,I know you want to think of yourself as joe the plumber,Dean,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.99,0:07:26.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.89,0:07:28.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.35,0:07:31.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你接受得越快你摆脱得越快\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sooner you accept that,the better off you're gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.09,0:07:32.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,管子工乔是个蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah,Joe the plumber was a douche.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.43,0:07:35.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要帮我了结这一切吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna help me finish this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.93,0:07:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.00,0:07:41.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们在这里做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.60,0:07:43.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh,just...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.57,0:07:44.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.60,0:07:46.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.61,0:07:49.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这--这--这  不是你想象的那回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,this -- this -- this is not what it looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.78,0:07:51.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.58,0:07:54.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看上去像恶魔崇拜仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause it looks like devil worship.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.05,0:07:55.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么? 才不是!\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.42,0:07:57.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这决不是给恶魔崇拜仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,this is not devil worship.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.38,0:08:01.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这--这--这个--呃--\N{\fnArial\fs30}This -- this is -- this -- this is,uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.42,0:08:03.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道怎么答才好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have a good answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.16,0:08:08.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我们先走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,we're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.39,0:08:11.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想走到哪儿去啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going anywhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.60,0:08:15.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想都别想\N{\fnArial\fs30}...ever again...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.17,0:08:18.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}...sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.41,0:08:24.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿拉斯泰尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alastair.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.05,0:08:28.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为你已经在油锅里炸得通透酥脆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you got deep fried,extra-crispy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.12,0:08:32.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是个儿科医生的皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the pediatrician I was riding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.69,0:08:35.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他老婆还在满世界找他呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}His wife's still looking for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.86,0:08:37.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真搞笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.32,0:08:40.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.56,0:08:43.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没时间聊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No time to chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.53,0:08:45.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过会儿还和死神有个浪漫约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a hot date with death.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.90,0:08:48.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.44,0:09:00.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变强了啊  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're stronger,sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.71,0:09:04.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是经常一个人躲着练习呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been soloflexing with your little slut?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.85,0:09:07.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会了解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.97,0:09:33.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,觉得怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.27,0:09:35.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-怎么样了？-痛死我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in pain,that's how I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.77,0:09:37.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,估计是脑震荡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I have a concussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.44,0:09:38.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要阿司匹林吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want some aspirin?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.74,0:09:41.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用了谢谢  豪斯医生(同名美剧的主角)\N{\fnArial\fs30}No thanks, House.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.18,0:09:44.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,demons,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.45,0:09:47.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好在有上天眷佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. so much for miracles.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.52,0:09:50.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次阿拉斯泰尔又怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what the hell happened with alastair again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.03,0:09:53.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说过了  他想把我扔起来  结果没成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you,he tried to fling me or whatever,and it didn't work,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.00,0:09:54.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后他就逃走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he bailed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.00,0:09:56.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他为什么没能把你扔出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,how come he couldn't fling you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.90,0:09:58.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上次他可是轻而易举\N{\fnArial\fs30}He chucked you pretty good last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.00,0:10:03.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这我不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.84,0:10:05.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  帮我个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam,do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.14,0:10:08.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想把秘密放在心里  我也没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're gonna keep your little secrets,I can't really stop you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.88,0:10:11.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但别把我当成个傻瓜 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But just don't treat me like an idiot,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.54,0:10:14.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么? 迪恩  我没什么秘密啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? dean,I'm not keeping secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.92,0:10:19.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.35,0:10:22.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你回去调查了个那个死去的孩子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,did you go back and q-and-a the dead kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.92,0:10:24.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.52,0:10:25.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比打电话过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby called.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.99,0:10:27.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他做了些调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did some digging.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.36,0:10:29.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后?\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.76,0:10:31.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他认为我是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thinks I'm right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.60,0:10:33.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里的死神不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Local reaper's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.53,0:10:35.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不仅仅是不见了  而是被绑架了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just gone -- kidnapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.57,0:10:37.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,魔鬼干的? 为什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}By demons? why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.10,0:10:39.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听听这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.91,0:10:43.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"新夜之下  噬死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}"and he bloodied death under the newborn sky -- sweet to taste,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.69,0:10:45.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,初尝味美且甘  咽后遂渐苦而涩"\N{\fnArial\fs30}But bitter when once devoured."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.78,0:10:48.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,华丽  到底什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swanky. what the hell's that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.18,0:10:52.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是一个不为人知的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,it's from a very obscure,very arcane version of revelations.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.45,0:10:54.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和我想的一样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means what I think it means?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.69,0:10:58.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是说  在冬至的夜晚杀掉一个死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basically,you kill a reaper under the solstice moon -- tomorrow night,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.42,0:11:01.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就是明天晚上  你就解开了一个封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way -- you got yourself a broken seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.03,0:11:03.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么去绑架死神? 死亡是不会消失的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you ice a reaper? you can't kill death.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.06,0:11:04.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  也许魔鬼们就能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. maybe demons can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.53,0:11:06.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想知道  现在那些天使们躲到哪儿去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell are the angels is what I want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.00,0:11:08.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这回  他们倒是能帮上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could use their help for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.54,0:11:11.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来只有我们自己解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like we're gonna have to take care of this one ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.47,0:11:12.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we gonna do,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.34,0:11:14.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大摇大摆这么去救死神? 救那些和谐的街坊?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just swing in and save the friendly neighborhood reaper?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.94,0:11:16.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你出主意吧  我洗耳恭听\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a better idea,I'm all ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.64,0:11:18.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  死神是看不见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean,reapers are invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.01,0:11:21.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有死人和垂死的人才能看到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only people that can see them are the dead and the dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.98,0:11:25.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果只有变成鬼才能看到的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,if ghosts are the only ones that can see them...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.19,0:11:26.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.02,0:11:30.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就变成鬼吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}...then we become ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.16,0:11:34.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还真是得脑震荡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do have a concussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.16,0:11:36.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有点疯狂  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds crazy,i know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.06,0:11:38.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是很疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.30,0:11:41.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么做?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.97,0:11:47.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道怎么说你们这两个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't even begin to tell you how crazy you two are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.74,0:11:51.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帕梅拉 您是我们的雪中之炭 黑暗中之光明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,pamela,you're a sight for sore eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.75,0:11:55.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是贴心啊  牢骚男\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw,that's sweet,grumpy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.68,0:11:57.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这话我这瞎子说  可有点讽刺啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say to deaf people?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.98,0:12:02.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪根筋让你想到这么个灵魂出窍的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one of you brainiacs came up with astral projection?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.09,0:12:04.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是您啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.29,0:12:06.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你当然这么说  查奇(1974年情景喜剧《欢乐时光》的角色)\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. Chachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.36,0:12:06.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.50,0:12:10.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讲清楚--你们要让灵魂从身体里出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's be clear -- you want to rip your souls out of your
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.56,0:12:14.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后在次元空间里面瞎转悠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bodies and take a little stroll through the spirit world?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.84,0:12:16.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恩哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.14,0:12:19.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们知不知道这有多疯狂啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea how heavy-duty insane that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.01,0:12:21.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许吧  但是死神在那儿  所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe,but that's where the reaper is,so...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.24,0:12:22.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  你们还是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,it's nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.81,0:12:24.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别说的好像你不知道这事的本质似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if you know what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.21,0:12:26.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你们不知道自己到底在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.31,0:12:27.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,but you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.71,0:12:28.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的确知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,i do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.75,0:12:30.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们晓得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.42,0:12:34.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被拉到你们这个关于天使魔鬼天堂地狱的交易里  我受够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sick of being hauled back into your angel-demon,soc-greaser crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.89,0:12:37.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也希望不掺和  回家看看法官朱迪多悠闲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,i'd love to be kicking back with a cold one,watching "judge judy,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.84,0:12:39.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好  还有关于瞎子的笑话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}too. nice. more blind jokes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.23,0:12:41.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你懂我的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.46,0:12:44.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们讨论的世界末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're talking the end of the world here,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.00,0:12:50.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候  不再有流苏裤子  不再有雷蒙斯唱片  什么都没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more tasseled leather pants,no more ramones cds,no more nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.64,0:12:53.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.78,0:13:03.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天才们  告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me something,geniuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.65,0:13:07.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们真的穿过帷帐  找到死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if you do break into the veil and you find the reaper,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.54,0:13:09.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们又要怎么去救他呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you gonna save it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.22,0:13:10.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该怎么做就怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}With style and class.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.89,0:13:13.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们到时候就是两片浮云\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna be two walking pieces
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.34,0:13:16.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,碰不到也移动不了任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of fog who can't touch or move anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.36,0:13:17.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没有防御力  两位高手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be defenseless,hotshot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.76,0:13:21.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记得有一群鬼魂曾经把我们打得半死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I seem to recall a bunch of ghosts beating the crap out of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.43,0:13:23.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们有的是时间练习\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,they had plenty of time to practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.57,0:13:26.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样  我们就得立即开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,then,i guess we got to start cramming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.14,0:13:28.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦  英雄二人行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow,couple of heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.84,0:13:32.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.18,0:13:34.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,躺下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lie down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.28,0:13:35.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭上双眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.39,0:13:45.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Animum vult decipi,ergo decipiatur.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.56,0:13:48.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Vis,vis,vis.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.00,0:13:52.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.17,0:13:53.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.50,0:13:54.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始行动吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Showtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.27,0:13:59.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么没有射太阳穴的感觉啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,nothing like shooting blanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.97,0:14:02.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,备用方案是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's plan "B"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.26,0:14:21.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉好像黛米摩尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,i'm so feeling up demi moore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.03,0:14:25.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  估计你们已经上了彩虹\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,so,I'm assuming you're somewhere over the rainbow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.27,0:14:28.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记住  我到时候还要把你们弄回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember,i have to bring you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.37,0:14:33.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会在你们耳边念咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll whisper the incantation in your ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.68,0:14:39.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可是有一对翘臀啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have got a great ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.61,0:14:43.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她 她说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd she -- what'd she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.39,0:14:54.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这真劲爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.84,0:15:04.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有感觉?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I making you uncomfortable?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.17,0:15:05.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快离开我的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.87,0:15:10.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是个玩不起的  走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're such a prude. come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.48,0:15:17.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  在这镇上我们已经飘荡了个把钟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,man,we've been spooking this town for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.35,0:15:19.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没见着恶魔  没见着黑烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}No demons,no black smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.25,0:15:22.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说还是去维多利亚秘密偷窥那些女生吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say we hit victoria's secret and get our peep on,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.92,0:15:24.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三点钟方向  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,hey,hey,3:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.72,0:15:26.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,注意窗口的小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid in the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.76,0:15:30.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事吧  他在看着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I crazy or is he looking at us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.80,0:15:32.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们之前见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 'cause we've seen him before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.43,0:15:33.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.57,0:15:34.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,报纸上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Newspaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.00,0:15:37.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,科尔 格里芬斯 这里死的最后一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cole griffith,the last person to die in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.05,0:15:46.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,科尔?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cole?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.58,0:15:50.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是妈妈啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.42,0:15:54.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你爸爸说我疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad thinks I'm crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.76,0:15:59.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.69,0:16:02.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个相框掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A picture frame fell over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.00,0:16:05.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我肯定那是你  宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have sworn it was you,baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.40,0:16:07.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还在我的身边吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you still here with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.41,0:16:18.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.51,0:16:23.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手! 你怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! how are you doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.72,0:16:26.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你们是谁 - 放轻松点 科尔 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you? relax,cole. it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.05,0:16:28.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道我的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.09,0:16:34.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能不太容易接受  但是你已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,this isn't gonna be easy to hear,but you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.59,0:16:37.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是一个鬼魂  我们也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a spirit. us too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.26,0:16:40.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  谢谢了  海利·乔  我知道自己已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,thanks,Haley Joel. I know I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.37,0:16:43.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们想干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.20,0:16:45.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只想和你聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just want to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.81,0:16:47.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聊什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.32,0:16:59.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我每天清晨就出门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was outside all morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.35,0:17:03.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都会提醒我如果太冷了就得小心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They tell you to be careful when it's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.76,0:17:05.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为冷空气会引发哮喘病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cold air can cause an asthma attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.13,0:17:09.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但事情发生在我回到房间后\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then I was in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.13,0:17:10.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那一切来得太快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It happened so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.76,0:17:14.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我大声叫妈妈过来  但始终都没人过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I called out for my mom,but nothing came out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.17,0:17:19.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接着就天昏地旋的  不久我就站在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything started spinning,and then I was just standing there,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.24,0:17:21.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着自己的躯体躺在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking down at my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.01,0:17:25.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就是那时你看到了那个家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's when you saw the man?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.91,0:17:29.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太可怕了  那个大伯穿着一套黑西装\N{\fnArial\fs30}Creepy,old guy in a black suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.12,0:17:33.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他要我跟他走  但\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted me to go with him,but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.92,0:17:36.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}...i didn't want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.76,0:17:38.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.89,0:17:40.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么摆脱他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you get rid of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.99,0:17:42.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么都没干\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.93,0:17:44.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是黑烟干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The black smoke did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.56,0:17:46.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black smoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.40,0:17:48.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这儿到处都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.33,0:17:51.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跑到衣柜里躲了起来  等我出来的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hid in the closet,and when I came out
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.59,0:17:53.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑烟和大伯都消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was gone,and so was he.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.74,0:17:57.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你知道那个黑烟去了哪儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know where the smoke went?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.58,0:17:59.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.41,0:18:00.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我能知道它在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.49,0:18:06.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.55,0:18:07.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.79,0:18:13.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其它的死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another reaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.63,0:18:16.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  我们想和你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! we need to talk to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.37,0:18:24.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.24,0:18:27.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认识你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I know you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.81,0:18:29.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们交情可深着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.00,0:18:36.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不记得了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.78,0:18:40.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说实话  如果每次女孩子对我这么说就有5分钱的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly,if I had a nickel for every time I heard a girl say that...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.48,0:18:44.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少你得给我点儿提示吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to freshen my memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.60,0:19:03.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,泰莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tessa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.75,0:19:07.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是我其中一个名字  想起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's one of my names,yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.69,0:19:08.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真得认识她\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,you do know her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.96,0:19:12.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那次车祸去得医院里\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the hospital after the accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.33,0:19:14.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和老爸一起那次吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The accident with dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.20,0:19:18.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么说  这个死神是追你的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,this is the reaper that came after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.47,0:19:20.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.60,0:19:22.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个笑话很冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,this was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.74,0:19:24.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好了  你说完了的话我就失陪了  -等等  先等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now,if you'll excuse me - wait,wait,wait,wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.26,0:19:26.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能  不能带走这孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't -- you can't take the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.88,0:19:29.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  这个镇上到处都是恶魔  这就是原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? demons are in town,that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.84,0:19:31.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们已经抓走了你的一个同族\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've already snatched your reaper pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.22,0:19:33.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那个孩子知道你同族的下落  -那又怎么样呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The kid knows where. - so?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.37,0:19:34.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  你应该马上离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,you should shag ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.02,0:19:36.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为就我们所知  他们绝对会再来抓你\N{\fnArial\fs30}For all we know,they could try and snatch you,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.59,0:19:40.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过这个镇就这里有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except that this town is off the rails,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.42,0:19:42.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而有人正在努力解决这个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}And someone has to set it straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.26,0:19:47.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  我们当然明白  但是目前的情况有点特殊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,we understand that,but these are special circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.86,0:19:50.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么情况  你的天使和恶魔在这儿开战了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? your whole angel-demon dance-off?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.16,0:19:52.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could care less.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.67,0:19:53.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只来做我该做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to do my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.17,0:19:56.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  我们可以帮你完成你的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right,yeah,and,look,we want to help you do your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.27,0:19:57.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-只希望你能先离开  -不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So,if you would just bail town. - no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.31,0:20:00.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你能不能等我们把事儿解决了之后再带走那孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,then,could you hold off until we fix this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.78,0:20:04.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.50,0:20:07.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  但是先把话说清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,but just so we're clear,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.86,0:20:11.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情一旦解决了  那么这个孩子就归我了\N{\fnArial\fs30} When I start reaping again,I'm starting with the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.12,0:20:15.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.39,0:20:18.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.99,0:20:20.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等下  先等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait,wait,wait,wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.76,0:20:22.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你打算怎么跟他说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna say to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.27,0:20:26.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽我所能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.53,0:20:59.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一切一定让你万全不知所措  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This all must be pretty overwhelming,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.70,0:21:03.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更让你惊恐不已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty scary,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.24,0:21:06.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我妈妈才是最难受的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The worst is my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.14,0:21:10.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到她这样心理一定很难受吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be hard seeing her like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.92,0:21:17.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她每天都会来我房间  和我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's always coming in here,talking to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.44,0:21:20.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我她有多伤心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Telling me how sad she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.82,0:21:23.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我故意弄翻东西想告诉她我在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knock some stuff over to let her know I'm here,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.73,0:21:27.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但那却让她更加地伤心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she only gets sadder.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.22,0:21:31.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你应该让足球飞得慢些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,you might want to ease up on the flying soccer balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.62,0:21:38.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会告诉你那些黑烟在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not telling you where the smoke is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.05,0:21:49.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那如果我告诉你只要你帮了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I told you that if you helped me...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.52,0:21:53.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就可以留下来  而且是永远的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't have to leave here -- ever?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.25,0:21:55.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪搂下那个死神呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the one downstairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.46,0:21:57.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,泰莎吗  她不会来打扰你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tessa? oh,she wouldn't bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.79,0:21:59.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其它死神也不会再来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No reaper would.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.56,0:22:02.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以和你的家人在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could just stay here with your family
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.89,0:22:04.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想陪他们多久都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}For as long as you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.30,0:22:08.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.34,0:22:10.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  没问题的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,you bet I can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.31,0:22:14.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}You swear?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.08,0:22:18.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.51,0:22:21.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,命运真是有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you,life is funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.78,0:22:23.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.82,0:22:26.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和我  又相遇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me -- together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.12,0:22:30.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会  不会是想打我的主意吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you -- are you making a move on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.59,0:22:33.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是唯一一个逃过此劫的人  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one that got away,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.46,0:22:36.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道这种发生几率有多甚微吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd be surprised how little that happens to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.47,0:22:42.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以帮我保守一个秘密吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I tell you something between you and me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.64,0:22:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还能跟谁说去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who am I gonna tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.74,0:22:51.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我们俩那次经历之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After our little,uh,experience...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.55,0:22:59.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有整整一年时间  我都觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}For that whole year,I felt like I had this...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.05,0:23:01.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的内心深处总有所空缺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hole in my gut...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.42,0:23:03.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像是我错失了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I was missing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.99,0:23:07.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直不知道究竟是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know what.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.70,0:23:10.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道那是什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what it was?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.77,0:23:12.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.47,0:23:19.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与父亲和萨姆生离死别的那种痛比起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pain of losing my father and sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.31,0:23:22.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.48,0:23:25.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真希望能永远和你呆在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I had gone with you for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.08,0:23:31.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但现在我完全不会在那么想了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I guess things are different now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.32,0:23:33.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.42,0:23:35.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就因为你有天使庇护吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angels on your shoulder?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.66,0:23:38.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来你也知道了  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,you know about that,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.49,0:23:40.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢  你误会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,hey,don't get me wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.26,0:23:42.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我见过的那些个翅膀男大多都很混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,most the ones I've met are dicks with wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.56,0:23:45.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But still...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.80,0:23:51.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对于我所做过的那些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,I've done things.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.01,0:23:52.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些令人发指的的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Horrible things.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.31,0:24:00.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而那些家伙却仍然给了我第二次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}And someone upstairs still decided to give me a second chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.72,0:24:04.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那真得让我觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just makes me feel...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.29,0:24:08.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也无法说清\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.36,0:24:15.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.23,0:24:19.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  科尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,Cole.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.23,0:24:21.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫泰莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Tessa.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.34,0:24:22.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会伤害你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.60,0:24:25.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的  科尔  就把你刚刚对我说的告诉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay,Cole. just tell them what you told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.21,0:24:30.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在我的葬礼上见到了黑烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the black smoke at my funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.75,0:24:32.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在公墓里\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the cemetery?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.55,0:24:35.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是在殡仪馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the funeral home.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.05,0:24:36.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里到处都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.59,0:24:42.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.16,0:24:43.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.80,0:24:51.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,泰莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tessa!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.83,0:24:53.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,科尔  你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cole,you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.70,0:24:56.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该怎么去对付这东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,how the hell are we supposed to fight that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.14,0:24:57.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我也不知道  得学会灵动才行吧  -今晚之前学会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know. learn some ghost moves? - by tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.07,0:25:01.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  没问题  你有一副宫本先生的之态了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,sure. I'll meet you back at Mr. Miyagi's.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.48,0:25:03.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宫本是谁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's Mr. Miyagi?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.88,0:25:11.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要集中念力才能移动它\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not gonna move if you don't concentrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.85,0:25:13.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正在集中呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am concentrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.69,0:25:22.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢  转起来吧  宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah,here we go,baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.66,0:25:24.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就坚持了那么一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pull a muscle?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.33,0:25:26.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 尤达大师  让我们见识下你的本事\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,Yoda,let's see what you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.85,0:25:45.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.59,0:25:47.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这够灵异的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are so amityville.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.49,0:25:49.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这根本不算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't even the good stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.09,0:25:53.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到了吗  如果你想揍某人的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? if you want to hit something,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.82,0:25:56.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-只要带点火气就行了  -嗯哼  知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You just got to get mad. - yeah,got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.40,0:25:58.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来试试  揍我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you try. hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.83,0:26:02.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我还是挑个和我长不多的家伙揍吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh,I think I'll stick to just picking on somebody my own size.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.17,0:26:06.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,试着狠狠地揍我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit me as hard as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.60,0:26:08.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小家伙  我不会和一个十二岁的小家伙玩拳击游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude,I'm not gonna do "fight club" with a 12-year-old.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.98,0:26:11.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了啊  别再来了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,cut it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.70,0:26:12.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.45,0:26:22.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个一定要教我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. whoa,you got to teach us that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.07,0:26:32.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就像个万恶之市一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This looks like "new jack city."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.97,0:26:34.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道就没人发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can nobody can see this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.94,0:26:38.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是恶魔隐形水画得吧  只有往生的人才能看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's demon invisible ink -- only see it in the veil.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.48,0:26:41.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道这是用来干嘛的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any idea what it's for?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.08,0:26:44.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就靠我们去查了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.68,0:27:16.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  看我露一手先\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude,check me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.43,0:27:43.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗  做一个鬼魂还挺爽的嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,this ghost thing -- it's -- it's kind of rad.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.48,0:27:54.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是铁器\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.19,0:28:04.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兔崽子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.49,0:28:08.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢这地方吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}...find the place okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.00,0:28:43.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下尝到石盐的滋味了吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rock salt's not so much fun anymore,is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.60,0:28:47.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿拉斯泰尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alastair...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.64,0:28:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.71,0:28:51.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽管来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.84,0:28:56.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么不用你那驱魔术了呢?  自命不凡的小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you try some of your mojo on me now,hotshot?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.25,0:29:00.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不披着人皮就很难做到吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hard to get it up when you're not wearing your meat,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.78,0:29:02.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚回地狱去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.35,0:29:03.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也想嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah,if only I could,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.70,0:29:08.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他们偏要我到这个冷死人的鬼地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they just keep sending me back up to this arctic craphole.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.59,0:29:10.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来杀死死神?\N{\fnArial\fs30}To kill death?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.43,0:29:13.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不  是杀两个  这样才能解开封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,to kill death twice. it takes two to break a seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.90,0:29:17.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我发现了另一个出现的地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured another one would show up,though.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.90,0:29:20.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们简直就像旅鼠一样好对付\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're like lemmings.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.17,0:29:29.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺便  再见到你真高兴 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way,it's,uh,good to see you again,dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.51,0:29:34.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想怎么射随便你  但你杀不了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can shoot us all you want,but you can't kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.59,0:29:39.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah,that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.32,0:30:10.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,月方上正中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moon's in the right spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.35,0:30:13.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,舞台已铺就\N{\fnArial\fs30}The board is set.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.09,0:30:15.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们好戏开场吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get started,shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.76,0:30:17.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就用这玩儿杀死神吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna kill a reaper with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.06,0:30:20.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不觉得有些蠢吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's little on the nose,don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.66,0:30:22.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.93,0:30:24.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个老朋友借给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}An old friend lent it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.97,0:30:28.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要知道  虽然他不是骑白马的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,he doesn't really ride a pale horse,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.46,0:30:31.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他也有三个伙伴(对比天启四骑士, 分别骑白红黑绿马)\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he does have three amigos.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.07,0:30:35.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而他们都很热衷于末日审判\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they're just jonesing for the apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.58,0:30:45.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总得照顾一下底下的伙伴  你说呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pays to have friends in low places,don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.56,0:31:01.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hic cruor messorius,illud sigillum,quod luciferem reverendum obstringit,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.76,0:31:05.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Aperiat ut resurgat!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.91,0:31:28.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Wind gusting no!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.17,0:31:31.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不!  住手!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.50,0:31:37.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hic cruor messorius...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.92,0:31:53.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.06,0:31:56.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  你这臭东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter,you reeking son of a bitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.73,0:31:58.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怕了女人了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You afraid of a skirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.88,0:32:19.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vis,vis -- ah! son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.99,0:32:33.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Illud sigillum,quod luciferem reverendum obstringit,aperiat ut resurgat!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.87,0:32:39.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.91,0:32:45.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你弟弟呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.07,0:32:46.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去找他  你快离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go find him. you get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.98,0:32:51.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Animum vult decipi,ergo...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.49,0:33:01.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帕梅拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pamela!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.22,0:33:30.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你笑什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.69,0:33:33.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能死  至少不该死在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't die -- not in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.49,0:33:34.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.89,0:33:41.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-帕梅拉  -少担心了  坏家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pamela -- quit your worrying,grumpy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.50,0:33:42.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我弄瓶酒来吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you make me a drink,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.93,0:33:44.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得去医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.23,0:33:46.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我弄瓶酒来 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make me a drink,sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.64,0:33:58.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跑不了的...迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't run...dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.72,0:34:03.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,逃不出我的手心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.12,0:34:10.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是缠绕在你内心的小小恐惧源\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm inside that angst-y,little noggin of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.40,0:34:20.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.50,0:34:23.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess again.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.53,0:34:32.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和萨姆刚保住了一个封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and sam just saved a seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.97,0:34:36.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我们抓住了阿拉斯泰尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We captured alastair.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.91,0:34:38.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩 这是一场胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean,this was a victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.14,0:34:39.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  但别指望我谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,no thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.74,0:34:42.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么这么说?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.78,0:34:46.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一直都在?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were here the whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.18,0:34:48.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自始至终都在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.59,0:34:50.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们被石盐折磨的时候你在哪儿?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,thanks for your help with the rock salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.75,0:34:54.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们无法破解葬礼屋的符号\N{\fnArial\fs30}That script on the funeral home -- we couldn't penetrate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.99,0:34:57.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有天使做不到的事情吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was angel-proofing?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.60,0:35:01.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然我干嘛开始求助你们?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think I recruited you and sam in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.03,0:35:04.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你求助我们的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You recruited us?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.17,0:35:09.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打电话给你们的不是鲍比 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't your friend bobby who called,dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.04,0:35:11.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他也没有告诉萨姆有关封印的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't bobby who told sam about the seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.68,0:35:13.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是你?\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.35,0:35:18.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你需要我们帮忙  干嘛他妈不直说?\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want our help,why the hell didn't you just ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.95,0:35:25.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你总是和我对着干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because whatever I ask,you seem to do the exact opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.42,0:35:27.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那现在呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,what now,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.09,0:35:29.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个镇上的人还是会死吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people in this town,they just gonna start dying again?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.53,0:35:31.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.23,0:35:34.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.20,0:35:37.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就不能破例几次吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What,you think you can make a few exceptions?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.23,0:35:39.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,万物注定轮回\N{\fnArial\fs30}To everything there is a season.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.57,0:35:41.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我你就破了例\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made an exception for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.24,0:35:47.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是与众不同的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're different.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.12,0:35:56.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.45,0:36:00.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could use your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.17,0:36:16.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好 科尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,cole.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.58,0:36:24.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样  和你弟弟说声谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell your brother thanks for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.58,0:36:28.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看她吧  Cole\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at her,cole.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.39,0:36:31.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意识到她有多么痛苦吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see how unhappy she is?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.89,0:36:34.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我才想留在她身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I want to stay with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.26,0:36:45.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要她依然能感觉到你  她就会一直痛苦下去 因为她放不下你\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as she can feel you,she'll be in pain,because she can't let go,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.71,0:36:49.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你也放不下她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you won't let go of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.68,0:36:54.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为何从没人告诉我那个世界是怎样的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why won't anybody tell me what's on the other side?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.44,0:36:56.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能因为这样你就没有惊喜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe nobody wants to ruin the surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.38,0:36:58.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不算答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.78,0:37:01.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不会给你答案的  Cole\N{\fnArial\fs30}She won't answer you,cole.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.22,0:37:04.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死神从不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reapers never do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.12,0:37:06.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是相信我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But trust me...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.82,0:37:10.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呆在这儿比另一个世界更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Staying here is a whole lot worse than anything over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.83,0:37:12.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.10,0:37:15.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总有一天  你的家人都会去世\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because one day,your family will be gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.43,0:37:19.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对你来说就一无所有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there will be nothing left here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.17,0:37:23.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害怕是正常的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay to be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.51,0:37:24.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.74,0:37:26.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都会害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.94,0:37:28.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the big secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.41,0:37:31.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有的人都会害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.99,0:37:36.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也会来吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.42,0:37:40.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我肯定会比你预料的要早来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,i'm sure I'll be there sooner than you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.26,0:38:20.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,留心那个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out for that boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.13,0:38:24.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要小心自己 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out for yourself,dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.10,0:38:25.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.27,0:38:31.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我经历过很多次死前临别\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been around death from the get-go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.51,0:38:33.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道我见过最多的是什么吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I see most?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.44,0:38:35.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.22,0:38:40.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"他会去到一个更好的地方"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"he's in a better place."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.38,0:38:42.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"不管怎样  他们终于在一起了"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"at least they're together now."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.95,0:38:49.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一直在骗自己 迪恩  因为如你所说  地狱深渊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all lie to yourselves,dean,'cause like you said,deep down,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.40,0:38:51.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只有恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.53,0:38:54.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再骗自己了 迪恩 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop lying to yourself,dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.63,0:38:56.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.50,0:39:00.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使们救了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angels have something good in store for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.07,0:39:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给了你第二次生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}A second chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.01,0:39:03.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.01,0:39:08.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我很确定...\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I'm pretty sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.11,0:39:09.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道在地狱...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deep down...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.78,0:39:13.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,深渊尽头的那令人骨悚然的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know something nasty's coming down the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.82,0:39:19.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信你的直觉 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust your instincts,dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.16,0:39:22.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世间本无奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no such thing as miracles.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.56,0:39:25.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想说什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.34,0:39:36.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Imum vult decipi,ergo decipiatur.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.54,0:39:38.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,中文字幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vis,vis,vis.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.62,0:39:47.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去和泰莎谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,we just got to talk to tessa,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.35,0:39:50.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要让她推迟一下  这样我们就能治好你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all -- get her to hold off reaping till we get you better.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.99,0:39:53.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我肯定她现在已经开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pretty sure she's started up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.30,0:40:02.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.70,0:40:04.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,泰莎呢? 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean,where's tessa?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.67,0:40:06.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她已经...\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.47,0:40:12.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-帕梅拉 我很抱歉  -闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pamela,i'm so sorry. stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.91,0:40:14.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你不该沦落至此的  -没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't deserve this. yeah,i don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.55,0:40:21.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早说了我不想被牵扯进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you I didn't want anything to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.48,0:40:23.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮我个忙好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do me a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.55,0:40:26.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让那个混蛋鲍比 辛格见鬼去!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell that bastard bobby singer to go to hell for
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.62,0:40:30.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他之前干嘛要介绍你们给我认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever introducing me to you two in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.33,0:40:33.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放松 帕梅拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy,pamela.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.73,0:40:36.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会去到一个更好的地方的 如果这算安慰的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's any consolation,you're going to a better place.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.34,0:40:42.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.44,0:40:45.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过管他呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what the hell,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.14,0:40:47.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每个人迟早都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody's got to go sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.88,0:40:53.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.72,0:41:03.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你对那个恶魔的所作所为 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you did to that demon,sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.66,0:41:07.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能感觉到你的内心深处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel what's inside of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.60,0:41:12.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你还认为这是出于好意 再考虑看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you think you have good intentions,think again.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.41,0:41:25.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帕梅拉?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pamela?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.49,0:41:32.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帕梅拉!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pamela!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.50,0:41:40.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她对你说了什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did she say to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.17,0:41:49.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[谨以此季献给Kim Manners]
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.37,0:41:57.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,